Package: vabaxos-ocr
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, python3-pil, tesseract-ocr, tesseract-ocr-ita, tesseract-ocr-eng
Recommends: vabaxos-settings
Description: Text recognition for the screen reader (OCR)
 Super+Alt+R recognizes the text of the window in use, Super+Alt+Shift+R
 of the whole screen, as NVDA+R does in NVDA: the text opens in a plain
 window that Orca reads line by line, for programs without accessibility,
 pictures and videos. The picture is taken by GNOME Shell (the extension
 vabaxos-keys@vabaxos.org of vabaxos-settings); tesseract recognizes
 Italian and English, after the picture is made larger and, on a dark
 background, inverted.
